  DisplayName: Improved Flexibility
  IconPath: icons/environment/settlement/target-dummy.webp
  Description: Your extensive experience gives you even greater ability to adapt
    to each day's challenges. When you use combat flexibility, you can gain two fighter
    feats instead of one. While the first feat must still be 8th level or lower,
    the second feat can be up to 14th level, and you can use the first feat to meet
    the prerequisites of the second feat. You must meet all of the feats' prerequisites.
